# Kept off the deployment.
#
# internal/sales.html has no authentication. Deployed, it is a public URL that
# exposes the launch-vs-real pricing, the qualification script and the red
# flags. A prospect who sees it knows the floor before negotiating.
# Its contents have since moved into the dashboard, which does have a login.
internal/

# Server-side SQL. Nothing to serve, and no reason to publish the schema.
supabase/

# Repo tooling, not part of the site.
scripts/
.github/
CLAUDE.md
README.md

# Internal notes. pricing.md lists every price including the launch rates, so
# this matters for the same reason internal/ does.
docs/

# The client status template. It ships with demo data ("קלאץ׳ סטור",
# "ישראל ישראלי") and is a template, not a page. Deployed it sits at
# /c/_template.html as a fake project belonging to nobody.
# Real client pages are copies of it under c/ with their own filename, and
# those still deploy: only the template itself is excluded.
c/_template.html
